{"openapi":"3.1.0","info":{"title":"App Builder API","version":"0.1.0","description":"Control plane for the App Builder: auth, app/config CRUD, image assets, the build\nqueue (the crown jewel), billing + provider webhooks, and read-only admin aggregates.\n\n## Authentication\nMost `/v1` end-user routes require a **bearer access token**. Obtain it from\n`POST /v1/auth/login` or `POST /v1/auth/signup`: the token is the `tokens.accessToken`\nfield of the response. Send it as `Authorization: Bearer <accessToken>`. The access\ntoken is short-lived; rotate it with `POST /v1/auth/refresh` using the opaque\n`tokens.refreshToken`.\n\nThere are **three separate auth boundaries**:\n- `/v1/...` end-user routes â user session JWT (`bearerAuth`).\n- `/v1/admin/...` â a completely separate admin realm (separate secret + mandatory MFA +\n  RBAC enforced on the data-fetch path). Documented here with `bearerAuth` for convenience,\n  but it is NOT the same token as the user realm.\n- `/v1/webhooks/...` â authenticated by provider signature (`Stripe-Signature`) or Pub/Sub\n  OIDC JWT; never a user bearer token.\n\nPublic, unauthenticated routes: `GET /healthz`, `GET /`, `GET /v1/assets/{assetId}/raw`\n(opaque-uuid capability), plus `/openapi.json` and `/docs`.\n\n## Errors\nAll errors share the envelope `{ \"error\": { \"code\", \"message\", \"requestId\", \"details\"? } }`.\nCodes map to status: `validation_error` 400, `unauthenticated` 401, `forbidden` 403,\n`not_found` 404, `no_entitlement` 402, `preflight_blocked`/`domain_unverified` 422,\n`conflict` 409, `rate_limited` 429."},"servers":[{"url":"/","description":"Relative to the current host (use this from Swagger UI)."},{"url":"https://api.genzonixglobal.com","description":"Production â fronted by Cloudflare (DNS proxy / tunnel) at the project domain."}],"tags":[{"name":"Auth","description":"Signup, login, token rotation, current user, device push token."},{"name":"Apps & Config","description":"App CRUD + immutable AppConfig versions, ownership, preflight."},{"name":"Assets","description":"Image upload (multipart), listing, metadata."},{"name":"Builds","description":"Enqueue (entitlement-gated, idempotent) + status, SSE, logs, artifacts, cancel."},{"name":"Billing","description":"Entitlement + Stripe Checkout / portal + Play purchase linking."},{"name":"Admin","description":"Read-only fleet / queue / overview aggregates (separate auth realm)."},{"name":"Webhooks","description":"Stripe + Google Play RTDN ingestion (provider signature)."},{"name":"Public","description":"Unauthenticated: health and public asset bytes."}],"components":{"securitySchemes":{"bearerAuth":{"type":"http","scheme":"bearer","bearerFormat":"JWT","description":"User access token from /v1/auth/login|signup â tokens.accessToken. Admin routes use a SEPARATE token in the same Authorization header."}},"schemas":{"ApiError":{"type":"object","required":["error"],"properties":{"error":{"type":"object","required":["code","message","requestId"],"properties":{"code":{"type":"string","enum":["unauthenticated","forbidden","not_found","validation_error","no_entitlement","preflight_blocked","domain_unverified","rate_limited","conflict","internal_error","webhook_processing_failed"]},"message":{"type":"string"},"requestId":{"type":"string","description":"Echoes the X-Request-Id response header."},"details":{"description":"Optional, code-specific. For validation_error: array of {path}. For preflight_blocked: {blocking[]}."}}}}},"SubscriptionStatus":{"type":"string","enum":["pending","active","grace","on_hold","canceled","expired"]},"BillingProvider":{"type":"string","enum":["stripe","google_play"]},"BuildStatus":{"type":"string","enum":["queued","claimed","building","uploading","succeeded","failed","canceled"]},"BuildNodeStatus":{"type":"string","enum":["active","draining","dead"]},"AssetType":{"type":"string","enum":["icon","splash","onboarding","media","other"]},"MemberRole":{"type":"string","enum":["owner","member"]},"AppStatu